# Play → Learn → Second Thoughts: place a card, select it and Recall it, then
# finish (generated by tools/gen-play.mjs); the results offer the next lesson.
until 300 Play
frames 10
click Play
until 60 Choose a mode
frames 10
click Learn
until 60 Second Thoughts
frames 10
save lessons
click Second Thoughts
until 120 Place any tray card onto the board.
frames 30
click Tray slot 2,
frames 5
click Row 1 column 2,
frames 10
until 60 Now recall that card back to the tray.
click Row 1 column 2,
frames 5
save lesson-selected
click Recall
until 60 Finish the mosaic at your own pace.
frames 10
save lesson-recalled
click Tray slot 2,
frames 5
click Row 1 column 2,
frames 10
click Tray slot 1,
frames 5
click Row 1 column 3,
frames 10
until 240 Next lesson
frames 20
save lesson-results
